    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head>Geþyn. 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">….</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">…</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif mássere geþeah, þæt he ferde þrige ofer wíd sǽ be his agenum cræfte, se wæs þonne syððan þegenrihtes weorðe.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if a merchant prospered, so that he fared three times over the wise sea by his own means, he was afterwards worthy of a thegn's rights.</ab>
      </div>
